{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13643","headline":"送薛居士和州读书 · 严维","name":"送薛居士和州读书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤云独鹤共悠悠，万卷经书一叶舟。\n楚地巢城民舍少，烟村社树鹭湖秋。\n蒿莱织妾晨炊黍，隅落耕童夕放牛。\n年少不应辞苦节，诸生若遇亦封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13643.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13643","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}